==Trivia==
*This Cat is the result of a collaboration between [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] and the [https://www.facebook.com/ponosgames/photos/pb.146953362028223.-2207520000.1442579824./830252677031618/?type=3&theater winner] of the [https://www.facebook.com/ponosgames/photos/pb.146953362028223.-2207520000.1442579835./824754954248057/?type=3&theater 12 Days of Catsmas Art Contest] on Facebook.
**Value Meal Cat's name is based off the winner's depiction of Catburger's Evolved Form.
*"Guerrilla" is misspelled as "guerilla" in Catburger's description.
*Prior to [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]], Catburger was exclusive to the English Version.
**Prior to BCJP [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]], Value Meal Cat was an exclusive True Form for the English Version.
*Prior to [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] [[Version 14.6 Update|Version 14.6]], Catburger was obtained by playing [[Faster Than Fast Food|Minced Meet-Up]] and its True Form was obtained by clearing [[Catburger Awakens!]]. In BCJP, it was always unlocked through Event Gachas and evolved through Catfruit.
*In [[Version 6.3 Update|Version 6.3]], there was a bug allowing Catburger's [[True Form]] to be unlocked through a [[Catfruit]] evolution, requiring no XP, no [[Catfruit]] and level -1. It evolved into yet another Cat Royale, but it had the stats of Cat Royale, had the appearance of Catburger and its icon in the upgrade screen and equip slot was that of [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Mohawk Cat]].
**Once [[Version 6.4 Update|Version 6.4]] was released, players who took advantage of this glitch received Catburger's real True Form for free.
*Catburger may have hinted at an international release for [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], but was instead cut as the game only released in Japan and the rest of Southeast Asia. This may have been due to poor sales outside of Japan when PONOS released [[The Battle Cats POP!]].
**In the game's files for the International version, there exists unused Cat Missions that allows players to get the unit for free, however it is unknown whether or not it will actually go live.

